  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "In fact, I reviewed PR https://github.com/volcengine/verl/pull/3522, and it seems that the model_forward_1f1b_overlap function can only be used on MoE models. For MoE models like Moonlight-16B-A3B-Instruct and Qwen3-30B-A3B, where tie_word_embeddings is false, the condition share_embeddings_and_output_weights being true will not occur.",
